<title>JAPAN: Daiwa Sec to provide 120 bln yen aid to affiliate.</title>
<headline>Daiwa Sec to provide 120 bln yen aid to affiliate.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Daiwa Securities Co Ltd said on Monday it would provide 120 billion yen in financial aid to a finance affiliate.</p>
</text>
